YSocial — Alembic migrations directory
=======================================

Managed by Flask-Migrate (https://flask-migrate.readthedocs.io).

Common commands (run from the repository root):

    flask --app y_social.py db current              # show current revision
    flask --app y_social.py db upgrade              # apply pending migrations
    flask --app y_social.py db migrate -m "msg"     # generate new migration
    flask --app y_social.py db downgrade -1         # roll back one revision
    flask --app y_social.py db stamp <rev-id>       # mark DB at revision

For existing databases (already at schema baseline):

    flask --app y_social.py db stamp 0001_baseline

See y_web/migrations/README.md for the pre-Alembic migration history.
